# Return to the Depths at Prog 9: the battlefield won, then its 32001 finished after a GM clears the local var
# battlefieldWin (`localvar battlefieldWin 0`): the quest's 32001 handler's other side (the var is not 737): nothing,
# Prog stays 9, no gil.
lists MineShaft2716/_0d0/onTrigger MineShaft2716/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=MineShaft2716 pos=-93.657,-120,-583.561 lvl=75
quest Bastok.OutOfTheDepths completed
quest Bastok.AQuestionOfFaith completed
quest Bastok.ReturnToTheDepths accepted
charvar Quest[1][78]Prog 9
login
trigger _0d0                         # Prog 9: the quest's handler nil; the battlefield's 32000 menu
update 32000 option=17               # index 1, area 1: registered, entered
finish                               # in the arena
kill TWILOTAK                        # area 1: won (his death alone ends it here), battlefieldWin 737, 32001 opens
localvar battlefieldWin 0            # GM: the win's local var cleared
finish                               # 32001, battlefieldWin 0: nothing (Prog 9)
